                "bold": true
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "That makes new combinations of alleles.",
          "write": "new allele combos"
        },
        {
          "say": "Independent assortment. Each pair lines up facing a random way.",
          "write": "2. independent assortment"
        },
        {
          "say": "With 23 pairs, that is 2 to the 23, about 8.4 million combinations.",
          "write": "2²³ ≈ 8.4 million"
        },
        {
          "say": "Random fertilisation. Any one of millions of sperm can fertilise the egg.",
          "write": "3. random fertilisation"
        }
      ]
